<title>USA: Associated Estates offers 1.75 mln shrs.</title>
<headline>Associated Estates offers 1.75 mln shrs.</headline>
<dateline>CLEVELAND 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Associated Estates Realty Corp said Wednesday it is offering 1.75 million common shares at $23.50 per share.</p>
<p>The company said it also granted the underwriter an option, exercisable within 30 days, to buy up to 262,500 additional common shares to cover over-allotments.</p>
<p>The underwriter for the offering is Morgan Stanley Dean Witter, the company said.</p>
<p>Associated Estates is a real estate investment trust.</p>
